node_modules/
dist/
.env
# This repeatedly caused Vercel builds to fail: npm on Windows kept
# regenerating a lockfile that only listed Windows-only optional native
# binaries (rolldown/oxlint/tailwindcss), which Linux's npm then refused
# to install with EBADPLATFORM. vercel.json's installCommand deletes it
# before every install anyway, so keeping it out of git entirely avoids
# ever re-introducing the broken, platform-locked version.
package-lock.json
